# The one place the bundled Codex App Server is pinned (#26, ADR 0013).
# One exact stable release of openai/codex, its two official macOS
# slices with the digests GitHub reports for them, and the licence and
# notice shipped beside them. tool/vendor-app-server.sh reads this;
# packages/sai_core/lib/src/llm/codex_app_server/protocol.dart names
# the same tag, and a test keeps them equal. Never a floating "latest",
# never an alpha: moving this line is its own pull request, with the
# protocol fixtures re-diffed and the whole suite rerun.
